  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "If you manage entitlement logic on your server, your server can call `Finish Transaction` after it finishes providing the customer with the new content. If you call `finish()` in your app, there’s no need to call the `Finish Transaction` endpoint from your server.",
